## Import

A trusted domain is imported by `<project_id>/<branch_id>/<domain>`.

Import using the [import block](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/import):

```hcl
import {
  to = {{.Name}}.example
  id = "curly-poetry-30604233/br-snowy-mountain-a5jkb18i/https://app.example.com"
}
```

Import using the command `terraform import`:

```commandline
terraform import {{.Name}}.example "curly-poetry-30604233/br-snowy-mountain-a5jkb18i/https://app.example.com"
```
